        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SDLA325, Heavy Duty Solid Brass Pocket Door Privacy Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use on sliding pocket doors, this privacy set is for doors that may need to be locked for privacy such as those found leading into bedrooms and bathrooms. An emergency turn on the exterior can unlock it. The Heavy Duty Privacy Pocket Door Pull is for use on 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\" thick pocket doors. It has a built in flip out edge pull, to get the sliding door out of its pocket. Easy to install, it comes packaged with all mounting hardware. Manufactured by Deltana, the nation\u0019's most complete provider for all your door hardware needs.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency turn. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SDLA325-Specifications.gif?v=1704354650\" width\"523\" height=\"237\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana SDLA325 Pocket Door Privacy Set Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-passage-pocket-door-pull-deltana-sdpa325\"><b>Pocket Door Passage Set</b></a> & <a href=\"/products/double-thumbturn-pocket-door-lock-sdlla325\"><b>Thumbturns Both Sides Pocket Door Lock</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana SDL25 Pocket Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout: 2-3/4\" High by 1-3/4\" Deep </li>\r\n<li>Emergency lock release on outside.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish screws and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li>Available in split finish (Polished Brass exterior / Polished Chrome interior).</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDLA325.pdf?v=1691095376\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana SDLA325 Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDLA325-install.pdf?v=1691095378\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana SDLA325 Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Heavy Duty Privacy Pocket Door Lock, Deltana SDLA325",
                "description": "Pocket Lock Deltana SDLA325 - For use on sliding pocket doors, this privacy set is for doors that may need to be locked for privacy such as those found leading into bedrooms and bathrooms. An emergency turn on the exterior can unlock it. The Heavy Duty Privacy Pocket Door Pull is for use on 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch thick pocket doors. It has a built in flip out edge pull, to get the sliding door out of its pocket. Easy to install, it comes packaged with all mounting hardware. Manufactured by Deltana, the nation\u0019's most complete provider for all your door hardware needs. Available in 11 finishes. ",
                "keywords": "DEL-SDLA325 Heavy Duty Pocket Door Lock, SDLA325,  del-SDLA325u3, del-SDLA325u10b, del-SDLA325u15, del-SDLA325u5, del-SDLA325u26, del-SDLA325u26d, deltana pocket locks, pocket privacy locks, sliding door pocket locks, deltana sdla325 heavy duty solid brass adjustable pocket lock privacy, pocket doors, SDLA325U3, pocket doors privacy locks, Pocket Door Hardware. pocket door catch, lock for pocket doors, 1-3/4 inch thick pocket door locks, 1 3/4 thick pocket door locks,"
